docs {
Verifikasi email user secara manual (admin/root). Dipakai kalau email OTP
gagal terkirim ke user sehingga user mentok di 403 EMAIL_NOT_VERIFIED.
Tanpa body. Perilaku sama dengan verifikasi OTP sukses: kolom
users.email_verified + email_verified_at diisi, baris OTP user dihapus,
event feed "Bergabung" (user_joined) tercatat, dan login user langsung
lolos.

200 sukses:
{
"success": true,
"data": {
"id": "01J...",
"email_verified": true,
"email_verified_at": "2026-10-27T00:00:00.000Z"
}
}

400 USER_NOT_FOUND (id tak ada), 400 ALREADY_VERIFIED (sudah
terverifikasi), 400 CANNOT_CHANGE_ANONIM (user sistem anonim),
401 tanpa token, 403 role bukan admin/root.
}
meta {
  name: Admin Verify User Email
  seq: 42
}
post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/users/:id/verify-email
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{access_token}}
}

vars:path {
  id: 01JHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHH
}

tests {
  test("200 verifikasi manual sukses", () => {
    expect(res.status).to.equal(200);
    expect(res.body.success).to.equal(true);
    expect(res.body.data.email_verified).to.equal(true);
    expect(res.body.data.email_verified_at).to.be.a("string");
  });
}
